# Claude Code / agent workflow — local-only, EXCEPT the two doc-authoring
# skills that ship with the template (part of its "Claude authors it" value).
# To un-ignore files inside an ignored dir, the parent dirs must be re-included
# first (git won't descend into an excluded directory), hence the /* + ! dance.
.claude/*
!.claude/commands/
.claude/commands/*
!.claude/commands/add-page.md
!.claude/commands/add-tab.md
/CLAUDE.md
